      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征现在正是巨星赛马娘之一，\n每天都有许多人争相采访。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8cf46770d0f5677fc3ab867d85f232fa690c465d6d8914f64108c64a9092550",
