    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aecf10e66fae229f70c552f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "致词结束后，粉丝感谢祭顺利开始了。\n而鲁道夫象征这次的重要舞台，\n是活动尾声的表演赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b1b7b95d0395a75429779362f074179ffc4e19832b7045b3db829deb78a4ec4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
