      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然说是表演赛，\n不过这场比赛的正式程度肯定跟竞赛相同。\n我希望她上午好好休息，以备下午的比赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0117a0f269a6d5514eec6b81299e27d0d15449cbfd8ae97017731f43864d8927",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
